==Battleground==
*7 [[Shibalien]]s (250%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s (250%) spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shibalien]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Maawth]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively easy with all [[:Category:Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], as they allow you to use units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly deal with Nimoy Bore and Maawth as well as any other attackers to completely anihilate this stage. Make sure to bring [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] or [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] for crowd-control, and you're good to go.

